url: 'https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/'
abstract: >-
  This repository contains the TEI XML files (EpiDoc) and
  associated authority and data files of the "I.Sicily:
  Inscriptions of Ancient Sicily" epigraphic corpus. This
  project aims to create and maintain the EpiDoc encoded
  editions of all inscriptions from the island of Sicily
  between approximately the 7th century BCE and the 7th
  century CE. The TEI files, together with supplementary
  data from other resources is made available through a web
  interface at https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk.
